  provenance: "AUTHORED exercise raid. Sea-skimmers: Harpoon-class (220 kg warhead,
    public), 290 m/s (AUTHORED, about Mach 0.85), 5 m, RCS \u221210 dBsm. Two waves
    of 4 sea-skimmers, from 050-070\xB0 then 290-310\xB0 40 s later, 3 s apart; 2
    strike aircraft at 6 km altitude from 000\xB0 and 020\xB0, 80 km out, flying
    a pass over the ship's starting position. They pass 6 km up, so TEWA L0 never
    ranks them a threat (closest approach over 3 km): they are the TAO's to engage
    by hand."
